# Herblore
Unfinished potions plus secondaries into finished potions.

```table
Method                          Cost  Profit     ROI
----------------------------  ------  ------  ------
Make Cadantine potion (unf)    2,201     298   13.5%
Make Ranarr potion (unf)       5,904     270    4.6%
Make Kwuarm potion (unf)       2,273     261   11.5%
Make Snapdragon potion (unf)   7,554     259    3.4%
Make Lantadyme potion (unf)    1,337     250   18.7%
Make Irit potion (unf)         1,505     210   14.0%
Make Dwarf weed potion (unf)   1,368     208   15.2%
Make Toadflax potion (unf)     2,255     182    8.1%
Make Torstol potion (unf)      3,526     160    4.5%
Make Super combat potion(4)   12,346     -28   -0.2%
Make Prayer potion(3)          6,999    -303   -4.3%
Make Super strength(3)         2,814    -422  -15.0%
Make Super attack(3)           1,753    -433  -24.7%
Make Super defence(3)          3,238    -734  -22.7%
Make Super restore(3)          8,155    -809   -9.9%
Make Ranging potion(3)         2,572  -1,053  -40.9%
Make Saradomin brew(3)         6,761  -1,490  -22.0%
Make Magic potion(3)           1,685  -1,577  -93.6%
```
